{"seq":3,"slug":"versioning-publishing","title":"版本管理与发布：Changesets、Lerna 与 semantic-release","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/versioning-publishing","wordCount":1116,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本管理与发布-changesets-lerna-与-semantic-release\">版本管理与发布：Changesets、Lerna 与 semantic-release</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Changeset</td>\n<td>描述一组包的变更类型（patch/minor/major）和变更描述的文件，由开发者在 PR 中创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本策略</td>\n<td>固定版本（所有包同步）或独立版本（每包独立）的发布模式选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHANGELOG.md</td>\n<td>记录每个版本变更内容的文档，由工具自动从 Changeset/commit 生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义化版本（SemVer）</td>\n<td><code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code> 的版本号约定：破坏性变更升 MAJOR，新功能升 MINOR，修复升 PATCH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace 协议替换</td>\n<td>发布时将 <code>workspace:*</code> 替换为实际版本号的过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pre-release</td>\n<td>正式发布前的预发版本（alpha/beta/rc），用于在生产前验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"changesets-拉取请求驱动的版本管理\">Changesets：拉取请求驱动的版本管理</h2><p>Changesets 是目前 JavaScript Monorepo 中最流行的版本管理工具，由 Atlassian（现为社区维护）开发。其核心理念是：<strong>版本变更应在代码变更时（PR 阶段）就声明，而非发布时再决定</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"changesets-工作流\">Changesets 工作流</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[开发者提交 PR] --&gt; B[运行 changeset add\\n创建 changeset 文件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[PR 合并到 main]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Changesets Release PR\\n自动聚合所有 changeset]&#10;    D --&gt; E[合并 Release PR]&#10;    E --&gt; F[自动发布到 npm\\n更新 CHANGELOG]\">graph LR\n    A[开发者提交 PR] --&gt; B[运行 changeset add\\n创建 changeset 文件]\n    B --&gt; C[PR 合并到 main]\n    C --&gt; D[Changesets Release PR\\n自动聚合所有 changeset]\n    D --&gt; E[合并 Release PR]\n    E --&gt; F[自动发布到 npm\\n更新 CHANGELOG]</pre><h3 id=\"安装和初始化\">安装和初始化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Changesets&#10;pnpm add -Dw @changesets/cli&#10;&#10;# 初始化（创建 .changeset/config.json）&#10;pnpm changeset init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Changesets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Dw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @changesets/cli</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始化（创建 .changeset/config.json）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>.changeset/config.json</code> 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://unpkg.com/@changesets/config@3.0.0/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;changelog&quot;: &quot;@changesets/cli/changelog&quot;,&#10;  &quot;commit&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;fixed&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;linked&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;access&quot;: &quot;restricted&quot;,&#10;  &quot;baseBranch&quot;: &quot;main&quot;,&#10;  &quot;updateInternalDependencies&quot;: &quot;patch&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ignore&quot;: [&quot;@myorg/app-web&quot;, &quot;@myorg/app-api&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://unpkg.com/@changesets/config@3.0.0/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"changelog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@changesets/cli/changelog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"commit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fixed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"access\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restricted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"baseBranch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"updateInternalDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"patch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ignore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/app-web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/app-api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键配置项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>access</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;public&quot;</code> 发布公开包，<code>&quot;restricted&quot;</code> 发布私有包或不发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updateInternalDependencies</code></td>\n<td>内部包升版时，依赖它的包的最小版本升级策略（<code>patch</code>/<code>minor</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ignore</code></td>\n<td>不参与版本发布的包（如应用包）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fixed</code></td>\n<td>强制同步版本的包组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>linked</code></td>\n<td>版本关联的包组（非强制同步，但同时发布时使用相同版本）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"开发者工作流-创建-changeset\">开发者工作流：创建 Changeset</h3><p>每当开发者提交影响公开 API 的变更，应创建一个 changeset：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 交互式创建 changeset&#10;pnpm changeset&#10;&#10;# 输出：&#10;? Which packages would you like to include? · @myorg/ui&#10;? Which type of change is this for @myorg/ui? · minor&#10;? Please enter a summary for this change ·&#10;  Add new Button variant: outline\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 交互式创建 changeset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Which packages would you like to include</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> · @myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Which type of change is this </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @myorg/ui</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> · minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Please enter a summary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> this change ·</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  Add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Button</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> variant:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> outline</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这会在 <code>.changeset/</code> 目录下创建一个随机命名的 <code>.md</code> 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;&#39;@myorg/ui&#39;: minor&#10;---&#10;&#10;Add new Button variant: outline\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Add new Button variant: outline</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个文件随 PR 一起提交，记录了&quot;这个 PR 引入了哪些包的哪种类型的变更&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ci-自动化-changesets-release-pr\">CI 自动化：Changesets Release PR</h3><p>配合 <code>changesets/action</code> GitHub Action，可以实现完全自动化的发布流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Release&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    name: Release&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;          token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v3&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          registry-url: https://registry.npmjs.org&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm build # 构建所有包&#10;&#10;      - name: Create Release Pull Request or Publish&#10;        id: changesets&#10;        uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          publish: pnpm changeset publish&#10;          version: pnpm changeset version&#10;          commit: &#39;chore: release packages&#39;&#10;          title: &#39;chore: release packages&#39;&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          registry-url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://registry.npmjs.org</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm build</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 构建所有包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Create Release Pull Request or Publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changesets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changesets/action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore: release packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore: release packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NPM_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当有未发布的 changeset 时，Action 会自动创建或更新 &quot;Release PR&quot;，PR 中包含所有包的版本变更和 CHANGELOG 预览。合并 Release PR 即触发实际发布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lerna-老牌多包管理工具\">Lerna：老牌多包管理工具</h2><p>Lerna 是最早的 JavaScript Monorepo 工具（2015 年），目前由 Nrwl（Nx 团队）维护。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lerna-的版本策略\">Lerna 的版本策略</h3><p><strong>固定版本模式（Fixed）</strong>：所有包保持同一个版本号，任何一个包的变更都会推高所有包的版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.2.3&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2.3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>适合场景：Babel、React 等包之间高度耦合，版本一致性比精细控制更重要。</p>\n<p><strong>独立版本模式（Independent）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;independent&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"independent\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>适合场景：企业内部工具库，各包发布频率和语义版本独立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lerna-与-changesets-的结合\">Lerna 与 Changesets 的结合</h3><p>现代实践中，Lerna 通常只作为发布工具使用，版本管理交给 Changesets：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;independent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;npmClient&quot;: &quot;pnpm&quot;,&#10;  &quot;useNx&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;command&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;publish&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;conventionalCommits&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;yes&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"independent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"npmClient\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"useNx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"publish\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"conventionalCommits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"yes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"semantic-release-基于-conventional-commits-的自动化\">semantic-release：基于 Conventional Commits 的自动化</h2><p>semantic-release 完全自动化版本管理，<strong>不需要开发者手动创建 changeset</strong>，而是通过分析 commit message 的格式来决定版本变更类型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"conventional-commits-规范\">Conventional Commits 规范</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;subject&gt;&#10;&#10;feat: 新功能 → MINOR 版本升级&#10;fix: 修复 → PATCH 版本升级&#10;feat!: 或 BREAKING CHANGE → MAJOR 版本升级&#10;chore/docs/style: 不触发版本升级\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;subject></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>feat: 新功能 → MINOR 版本升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fix: 修复 → PATCH 版本升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>feat!: 或 BREAKING CHANGE → MAJOR 版本升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chore/docs/style: 不触发版本升级</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"monorepo-中的-semantic-release\">Monorepo 中的 semantic-release</h3><p>单仓库的 semantic-release 配置（各包独立配置）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;branches&quot;: [&quot;main&quot;],&#10;  &quot;plugins&quot;: [&#10;    &quot;@semantic-release/commit-analyzer&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@semantic-release/release-notes-generator&quot;,&#10;    [&#10;      &quot;@semantic-release/changelog&quot;,&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;changelogFile&quot;: &quot;CHANGELOG.md&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;@semantic-release/npm&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@semantic-release/git&quot;&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"branches\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"@semantic-release/commit-analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"@semantic-release/release-notes-generator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@semantic-release/changelog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"changelogFile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CHANGELOG.md\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"@semantic-release/npm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"@semantic-release/git\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>semantic-release-monorepo</code> 插件支持 Monorepo 场景，通过分析 commit scope 判断哪个包需要发布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种工具的选型对比\">三种工具的选型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Changesets</th>\n<th>Lerna</th>\n<th>semantic-release</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版本声明时机</td>\n<td>PR 阶段（手动）</td>\n<td>发布时（半自动）</td>\n<td>自动（分析 commit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>commit 规范要求</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>必须（Conventional Commits）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHANGELOG 生成</td>\n<td>是（基于 changeset 描述）</td>\n<td>是（基于 commit）</td>\n<td>是（基于 commit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预发版本支持</td>\n<td>是（pre 模式）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo 支持</td>\n<td>一流</td>\n<td>一流（原生）</td>\n<td>需插件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队规模适合</td>\n<td>所有规模</td>\n<td>中大型</td>\n<td>强调 commit 纪律的团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护状态</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n<td>活跃（Nx 维护）</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选型建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优先 Changesets</strong>：适合绝大多数场景，PR 驱动的工作流与 GitHub PR review 融合最佳</li>\n<li><strong>Lerna 适合</strong>：已有 Lerna 历史、或需要与 Nx 深度集成的大型项目</li>\n<li><strong>semantic-release 适合</strong>：团队严格遵守 Conventional Commits，且希望完全自动化发布</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>版本管理与发布是 Monorepo 工程成熟度的体现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Changesets 是当前最佳实践</strong>：PR 阶段声明变更，Release PR 聚合发布，与 GitHub 工作流无缝融合</li>\n<li><strong>应用包标记 <code>ignore</code></strong>：只有被外部消费的库包才需要版本发布</li>\n<li><strong><code>workspace:*</code> 在发布时自动替换</strong>：Changesets 和 pnpm publish 会正确处理 workspace 协议</li>\n<li><strong>CHANGELOG 应自动生成</strong>：不要手动维护，工具生成的 CHANGELOG 更准确且无遗漏</li>\n<li><strong>pre-release 用于验证</strong>：alpha/beta/rc 版本可在生产环境前验证，降低发布风险</li>\n<li><strong>发布流程应通过 CI 自动化</strong>：避免本地发布带来的环境一致性问题</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"shared-config-conventions\">共享配置与约定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"affected-testing\">受影响分析与精准测试</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本管理与发布：Changesets、Lerna 与 semantic-release","id":"版本管理与发布-changesets-lerna-与-semantic-release"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Changesets：拉取请求驱动的版本管理","id":"changesets-拉取请求驱动的版本管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Changesets 工作流","id":"changesets-工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"安装和初始化","id":"安装和初始化"},{"level":3,"text":"开发者工作流：创建 Changeset","id":"开发者工作流-创建-changeset"},{"level":3,"text":"CI 自动化：Changesets Release PR","id":"ci-自动化-changesets-release-pr"},{"level":2,"text":"Lerna：老牌多包管理工具","id":"lerna-老牌多包管理工具"},{"level":3,"text":"Lerna 的版本策略","id":"lerna-的版本策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Lerna 与 Changesets 的结合","id":"lerna-与-changesets-的结合"},{"level":2,"text":"semantic-release：基于 Conventional Commits 的自动化","id":"semantic-release-基于-conventional-commits-的自动化"},{"level":3,"text":"Conventional Commits 规范","id":"conventional-commits-规范"},{"level":3,"text":"Monorepo 中的 semantic-release","id":"monorepo-中的-semantic-release"},{"level":2,"text":"三种工具的选型对比","id":"三种工具的选型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"受影响分析与精准测试：git diff → task graph → selective run","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/affected-testing"},"next":{"title":"CI 优化策略：分片、并行与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/ci-optimization-monorepo"}}